EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Congratulations on your conditional admission to Arizona State University! I want to follow up to let you know that you can be admitted to ASU when you submit a TOEFL score or when you complete Global Launch Advanced Level 2. There are many options available for taking the TOEFL exam right here at ASU (https://uoeee.asu.edu/exam/toefl).

Please let me know what your plans are or if you already have a TOEFL or IELTS score that you haven’t sent to us. Feel free to contact me or anyone else on the International Admission Services team if you have any additional questions.

Regards,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
